## Data Migration

### Results

| Table | Count |
|-------|-------|
| scholarships | 54 |
| ScholarshipDoc (embeddings) | 152 |
| guides | 3 |
| prompt_cache | 93 |
| profiles | 132 (126 with data, 6 empty) |
| user_bookmarks | migrated |
