### Scripts (in `/scripts/`)

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `migrate-content.mjs` | Migrates scholarships, ScholarshipDoc (embeddings), guides, prompt_cache |
| `migrate-users.mjs` | Imports users from Supabase CSV into Clerk + creates Neon profile rows |
